                "bio": "The mastermind behind the golden age of Warner Bros. Cartoons. Chuck Jones elevated the Looney Tunes from mere slapstick to brilliant, meta-theatrical, and mathematically precise comedic art. He defined the personalities of Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck, and Wile E. Coyote.",
