                "quote": "I want to create a world that is its own self-contained universe.",
                "bio": "While primarily a live-action auteur, Wes Anderson’s forays into stop-motion animation represent the ultimate distillation of his obsessively controlled, diorama-like aesthetic. His animation work allows him absolute geometrical control over every frame.",
                "style": "Planimetric composition, symmetrical framing, deadpan voice acting, obsessive attention to miniature detailing, and lateral tracking shots.",
