                "bio": "A founding pioneer of Direct Cinema, D. A. Pennebaker revolutionized the music documentary. Utilizing newly invented lightweight, sync-sound cameras, he stripped away narration and interviews to capture the raw, electrifying reality of 1960s counterculture.",
