                "quote": "Imagine an eye unruled by man-made laws of perspective, an eye unprejudiced by compositional logic.",
                "bio": "The titan of the American abstract avant-garde. Stan Brakhage sought to destroy the literary and theatrical traditions of cinema, stripping film down to its absolute purest essence: light, color, and raw, pre-linguistic vision.",
