                "quote": "My films are attempts to make a completely concrete film.",
                "bio": "A Canadian polymath and the leading figure of 'Structural Film'. Michael Snow was obsessed with the mechanical properties of the camera itself—time, space, framing, and movement—using them to create intensely rigorous, mathematical cinematic experiments.",
