                "region": "experimental",
                "era": "experimental-structural",
                "quote": "A film is a machine made of words and images.",
                "bio": "A brilliantly intellectual structural filmmaker and photographer. Hollis Frampton approached cinema as a mathematical and linguistic puzzle, creating highly conceptual films that demand the audience decode their underlying rule sets.",
